        # Strategy:
        # - Low complexity: Fast, cost-effective models (phi-3-mini, gpt-oss-20b)
        # - Medium complexity: Balanced models (llama-3.1-8b, mixtral for coding)
        # - High complexity: High-quality models (llama-3.1-70b, llama-3.3-70b, gpt-oss-120b)
